@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "User" as User

package "Three-Tier Architecture" {
    
    component "Frontend (React)" as UI
    note right of UI
      UI / Components
      State management
      User interactions
      Search & filtering
    end note

    component "FastAPI (REST)" as API
    note right of API
      Handles REST API requests
      Business logic (movies, ratings, users, etc.)
      Authentication & authorization
      Integrates with PostgreSQL
      External services (e.g., background jobs)
    end note

    database "PostgreSQL" as DB
    note bottom of DB
      Relational database
      Movies, Users, Ratings
      Genres, Favorites, etc.
    end note

    database "Redis (Optional)" as Cache
    note bottom of Cache
      In-memory data store
      Caching (frequently accessed data)
      User sessions & tokens
      Rate limiting
    end note

}

User --> UI : Interaction (Browser)
UI --> API : HTTP / REST API
API --> DB : SQL Queries (Read/Write)
API ..> Cache : Read/Write cache
@enduml
